{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-15","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平行线与线段","englishTitle":"If two straight lines meeting one another be parallel to two straight lines meeting one another, not being in the same plane, the planes through them are parallel.","book":11,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","contentId":"euclid-11-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6c7d2e121b73d63488a07ed10e19c0fcf307ed847182640384ff79a1d50934e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-15.statement","euclid-11-15.construction.1","euclid-11-15.construction.2","euclid-11-15.proof.1","euclid-11-15.proof.2","euclid-11-15.proof.3","euclid-11-15.proof.4","euclid-11-15.proof.5","euclid-11-15.proof.6","euclid-11-15.proof.7","euclid-11-15.conclusion","euclid-11-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a3f8d52bb33ef0a315b2392ad0dae7c04cefc7783eed7743f14ad40376a66cc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines meeting one another be parallel to two straight lines meeting one another, not being in the same plane, the planes through them are parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条直线相互相交, 与两条直线平行, 而不是在同一条平面线, 则平面线通过它们是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b77878833917e62fe4ac30784156d6a4202bbb916e2c45ab6b8cf92bfd470a1a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two straight lines AB, BC meeting one another be parallel to the two straight lines DE, EF meeting one another, not being in the same plane; I say that the planes produced through AB, BC and DE, EF will not meet one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB、BC两条直线相互相交,与DE、EF直线平行,不是同一条平面线;我说,平面延伸至AB、BC和DE,EF不会相互相交。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"678b27e0ae000f63a054373bb9d23708da6f579d31c142d94de839c7e7543c86","citations":["euclid-11-11","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BG be drawn from the point B perpendicular to the plane through DE, EF [[XI. 11](/principles/euclid-11-11)], and let it meet the plane at the point G; through G let GH be drawn parallel to ED, and GK parallel to EF. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG从B点直线划至平面至DE点,EF,再从G点划为平面点;G划至GH,再划至ED,再划至GK。 [[XI. 11](/principles/euclid-11-11)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a38b618298373affe50631e5f422e959fb824619efe5dadc3554b1c4b59bf601","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since BG is at right angles to the plane through DE, EF, therefore it will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane through DE, EF. [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,BG是直角到平面到DE,EF, 它将达到直角, 直线相交,在平面到DE,EF之间。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ade878a0612308f50f0462b9405af510cd06a19fbebf02e103619d39c24def8a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But each of the straight lines GH, GK meets it and is in the plane through DE, EF; therefore each of the angles BGH, BGK is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GH,GK直线的每一个线都相交, 位于平面到DE,EF; 因此,每个角度BGH,BGK是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34d53201b0270e7edb9657b874d0915287fd68278e4c3f4733a467aeab487fc2","citations":["euclid-11-9","euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BA is parallel to GH, [[XI. 9](/principles/euclid-11-9)] therefore the angles GBA, BGH are equal to two right angles. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有因为BA和GH是平行的因此,角度GBA,BGH等于2,直角。 [[XI. 9](/principles/euclid-11-9)] [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"096a60618ef5506d23c1856ebbeb04f5a8d134e2277b181326e055ccb15ac4a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle BGH is right; therefore the angle GBA is also right; therefore GB is at right angles to BA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BGH该角是直角,因此GBA角度也是正确的,因此GB角度为直角至BA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0decd0a8652f3b0e68c7334ef3ff1547fc8e5b9c25e13ae49d32cf8d6bc5479","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason GB is also at right angles to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,GB也为直角至BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"937f36407a70aaf59cd770cd2aa9ecc525f24a5f4a29d56d953a3f067636492d","citations":["euclid-11-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the straight line GB is set up at right angles to the two straight lines BA, BC which cut one another, therefore GB is also at right angles to the plane through BA, BC. [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,GB线线被定为直角至BA线,BC线相互分割,因此GB线也为直角至平面至BA,BC线。 [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c1fb4b0ab562c40bdeadb162ab0dc897d1b622022ea639206c6ff7f0eab371f","citations":["euclid-11-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But planes to which the same straight line is at right angles are parallel; [[XI. 14](/principles/euclid-11-14)] therefore the plane through AB, BC is parallel to the plane through DE, EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但平面线线与直角线是平行的,因此平面至AB线与平面至DE线是平行的,EF线与平面至AB线是平行的。（相关点与线段：BC） [[XI. 14](/principles/euclid-11-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5541c85fec78f41320f43a2fe3a22cea210a52172f8930114da6d7eec0c1af60","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if two straight lines meeting one another be parallel to two straight lines meeting one another, not in the same plane, the planes through them are parallel. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果两条直线相互相交,而两条直线相互相交,而不是在同一条平面线之间,那么平面线之间是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-15.source","contentId":"euclid-11-15","revisionId":"euclid-11-15@raw-b6c7d2e121b73d63","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c78ffc125b72968aaa678c7916f7731925f43632a160bb1b5a19f937dc55222c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XI. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XI. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XI. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-15.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.15/","sourceLabel":"XI. 14"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-11:explicit","id":"euclid-11-11","book":11,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"从平面外一点向平面作垂线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-1-31:explicit","id":"euclid-1-31","book":1,"number":31,"kind":"proposition","title":"过已知点作已知直线的平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-def-3","book":11,"number":3,"kind":"definition","title":"直线垂直于平面","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-9:explicit","id":"euclid-11-9","book":11,"number":9,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平行线与线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-1-29:explicit","id":"euclid-1-29","book":1,"number":29,"kind":"proposition","title":"平行线性质：内错角、同位角与同旁内角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-4:explicit","id":"euclid-11-4","book":11,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"同时垂直两条相交直线则垂直其所在平面","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-15:euclid-11-14:explicit","id":"euclid-11-14","book":11,"number":14,"kind":"proposition","title":"垂直同一直线的两个平面互相平行","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
